    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From filthy back alleys to forbidden pleasures \u2014 your story is just getting started.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019re a street-smart con artist, born in the gutter but dreaming big: a cozy house, chests full of gold, and a busty farm girl in your bed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a world where power, lust, and betrayal rule the game, it\u2019s not about who\u2019s strongest \u2014 it\u2019s about who\u2019s smartest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steal from the pompous nobles, hustle your way into riches, seduce whoever you need to, and carve out your own naughty little paradise.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your choices shape your destiny \u2014 and your dirty adventures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3684740/extras/12b17bf31d7e8fb5effb3eb69602be77.poster.avif?t=1755520184\" width=600 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3684740/extras/12b17bf31d7e8fb5effb3eb69602be77.webm?t=1755520184\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3684740/extras/12b17bf31d7e8fb5effb3eb69602be77.mp4?t=1755520184\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>is\u00a0 Crown of Lust [18+] \ud83d\udc51\u00a0a bold 18+ visual novel for those who know that real power lies not in swords, but in wit... and a little bit of irresistible charm. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udccf Master the art of the hustle</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lie, cheat, and seduce your way through the highborn elites \u2014 brains over blades, always.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udc8b Spicy romance and steamy 18+ scenes</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Flirt, conquer, and dive into fully uncensored adult encounters. Your choices unlock wild new adventures between the sheets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udc51 A dark, seductive medieval world</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a city dripping with secrets, gold, and temptation. From shady taverns to noble chambers \u2014 no place is off-limits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udd25 Seduction is your secret weapon</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Charm the pants off the rich and powerful. Win hearts, steal fortunes, and leave a trail of broken promises (and moaning lovers) behind you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfb2 All-in or nothing</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play dirty in high-stakes games where every risk could lead to mind-blowing rewards \u2014 or your total downfall.</p>",
